created for this publication on September 8, 2026. Not a documentary photograph.","source":"https://theorganiclub.com/images/iceberg.jpg","license":"Original artwork","licenseUrl":"https://theorganiclub.com/en/about/#images"},"en":{"title":"What Is AGD Marketing? Account-Generated Distribution Explained","dek":"Everyone can produce. Almost nobody knows how to distribute. Welcome to the other side of the iceberg."},"readingMinutes":5},"lang":"en"}]]}]]}]
